<template>
 <div class="v21-stack">
  <header class="v21-header"><div><div class="v21-eyebrow">Workspace / 采集器</div><h1>{{selectedWorkflow?.name||'采集器'}}</h1><p>为目标数据集配置来源，在发布前用真实样例预览保存结果。</p></div><div class="v21-actions"><el-button @click="load">刷新</el-button><el-button type="primary" :disabled="!projectId||!datasets.length" @click="startWizard">添加来源</el-button></div></header>
  <p v-if="error" class="v21-error" role="alert">{{error}}</p>
  <div v-if="!datasets.length&&!loading" class="v21-empty">先创建目标数据集，再添加采集器。<router-link class="v21-link" to="/workspace/data">前往数据集 →</router-link></div>
  <div class="collector-layout" v-else><aside class="v21-card collector-list"><h2>来源列表</h2><div v-if="loading" class="v21-empty">加载中…</div><div v-else-if="!workflows.length" class="v21-empty">当前项目没有采集器。点击“添加来源”开始。</div><button v-for="item in workflows" :key="item.id" class="collector-item" :class="{active:item.id===selectedId}" @click="selectWorkflow(item.id)"><strong>{{item.name}}</strong><small>{{datasetName(item.dataset_id)}} · {{item.published_version_id?'已发布':'未发布'}}</small></button></aside>
   <section class="v21-card collector-main"><div v-if="!selectedWorkflow" class="v21-empty">选择一个采集器，或从模板创建第一个来源。</div><template v-else><div class="collector-head"><div><span class="v21-eyebrow">{{datasetName(selectedWorkflow.dataset_id)}} / {{selectedWorkflow.code}}</span><h2>{{selectedWorkflow.name}}</h2><span class="v21-status" :class="selectedWorkflow.published_version_id?'ok':'warn'">{{selectedWorkflow.published_version_id?'已发布':'待发布'}}</span></div><div class="v21-actions"><el-button :disabled="!selectedWorkflow.published_version_id" @click="runNow">手动运行</el-button><el-button v-if="supportedDefinition && version?.status==='draft'" type="primary" @click="publish">发布版本</el-button></div></div>
    <div class="v21-note"><div class="v21-field"><label for="collector-owner">负责人</label><input id="collector-owner" v-model="ownerName" maxlength="128" placeholder="小团队维护人" /></div><el-button :loading="busy" @click="saveOwner">保存负责人</el-button></div><div v-if="repairTask" class="v21-note">来自运行页面任务 #{{repairTask}}。{{version?.status==='draft'?'已预填样例来源，请检查规则后保存样例并预览。':'先点击“创建编辑草稿”，再保存此页面为样例。'}}</div>
    <nav class="collector-tabs" aria-label="采集器内容"><button v-for="tab in tabs" :key="tab.id" :class="{active:activeTab===tab.id}" @click="activeTab=tab.id">{{tab.name}}</button></nav>
    <template v-if="activeTab==='ai'"><h3>AI 辅助修复</h3><p class="v21-note">仅对已保存的草稿样例提出字段选择器建议和失败解释。建议需人工确认，再保存为普通规则草稿并回归样例；正式采集不会调用 AI。</p><div class="editor-grid"><div class="editor-form"><div class="v21-field"><label>样例</label><select v-model.number="aiSampleId" @change="aiPrepared=null;aiConsent=false"><option :value="0">选择样例</option><option v-for="sample in samples" :key="sample.id" :value="sample.id">#{{sample.id}} · {{sample.page_role}} · {{sample.note}}</option></select></div><div class="v21-field"><label>需要解释的失败（可选）</label><textarea v-model="aiFailure" maxlength="1000" placeholder="例如：title 字段提取为空；请建议新的选择器" /></div><el-button :disabled="!aiSampleId||version?.status!=='draft'" :loading="busy" @click="prepareAI">检查发送内容</el-button><template v-if="aiPrepared"><p>模型：{{aiPrepared.model}} · 每日请求上限 {{aiPrepared.max_requests_per_day}} · {{aiPrepared.truncated?'原文已裁剪':'完整样例'}} · SHA {{aiPrepared.content_hash.slice(0,12)}}</p><details open><summary>将发送的样例内容</summary><pre class="json-box">{{aiPrepared.content}}</pre></details><label><input v-model="aiConsent" type="checkbox" /> 我已检查并同意发送此样例给配置的 AI 服务</label><div class="v21-actions"><el-button type="primary" :disabled="!aiConsent" :loading="busy" @click="suggestAI">请求建议</el-button></div></template></div><div class="editor-preview"><h3>建议审核</h3><div v-if="!aiSuggestions.length" class="v21-empty">暂无建议。</div><div v-for="item in aiSuggestions" :key="item.id" class="step-card"><strong>#{{item.id}} · {{item.model}} · {{item.status}}</strong><p>{{aiResult(item).explanation}}</p><div v-for="rule in aiResult(item).suggestions||[]" :key="rule.field" class="v21-row"><span>{{rule.field}} ← {{rule.selector}}{{rule.attribute?' @'+rule.attribute:''}} · {{rule.reason}}</span></div><small>样例 #{{item.sample_id}} · {{item.input_tokens}} / {{item.output_tokens}} tokens</small><div v-if="item.status==='pending_review'" class="v21-actions"><el-button @click="reviewAI(item,'accepted')">接受并填入当前规则</el-button><el-button @click="reviewAI(item,'rejected')">拒绝</el-button></div></div></div></div></template>
    <template v-if="activeTab==='plugins'"><h3>记录提交后执行</h3><p class="v21-note">仅正式采集的新建或更新记录触发。预览、样例检查和重放不会派发；插件可能向外部服务创建下载任务，失败可在任务监控重试。</p><div class="editor-grid"><div class="editor-form"><div class="v21-field"><label>插件</label><select v-model="pluginForm.plugin_code"><option v-for="item in pluginCapabilities" :key="item.code" :value="item.code">{{item.code}} · {{item.capabilities.join(', ')}}</option></select></div><div class="v21-field"><label>事件</label><select v-model="pluginForm.event_type"><option value="record.created">记录新建</option><option value="record.updated">记录更新</option></select></div><div class="v21-field"><label>下载 URL 字段</label><select v-model="pluginForm.url_field"><option v-for="field in pluginFields" :key="field.field_key" :value="field.field_key">{{field.label}} ({{field.field_key}})</option></select></div><div class="v21-field"><label>范围</label><select v-model="pluginForm.scope"><option value="workflow">当前采集器</option><option value="dataset">整个数据集</option></select></div><div class="v21-field"><label>启用</label><el-switch v-model="pluginForm.enabled" /></div><el-button :disabled="!pluginCapabilities.length||!pluginFields.length" :loading="busy" @click="savePluginSubscription">添加订阅</el-button></div><div class="editor-preview"><h3>当前适用订阅</h3><div v-if="!pluginSubscriptions.length" class="v21-empty">尚未配置，采集记录不会触发插件。</div><div v-for="item in pluginSubscriptions" :key="item.id" class="v21-row"><span>{{item.plugin_code}} · {{item.event_type}} · {{item.url_field}} · {{item.workflow_id?'当前采集器':'整个数据集'}} · {{item.enabled?'启用':'停用'}}</span><div class="v21-actions"><el-button size="small" @click="togglePluginSubscription(item)">{{item.enabled?'停用':'启用'}}</el-button><el-button size="small" type="danger" @click="deletePluginSubscription(item)">删除</el-button></div></div><h3>最近插件任务</h3><div v-for="task in pluginTasks" :key="task.id" class="v21-row"><span>#{{task.id}} · {{task.plugin_code}} · {{task.event_type}} · {{task.status}} · 记录 #{{task.record_id}}</span><small>{{task.error_message}}</small><div class="v21-actions"><el-button v-if="task.status==='failed'||task.status==='cancelled'" size="small" @click="retryPluginTask(task.id)">重试</el-button><el-button v-if="task.status==='queued'||task.status==='running'" size="small" @click="cancelPluginTask(task.id)">取消</el-button></div></div></div></div></template>
    <template v-if="activeTab==='editor'"><div v-if="!version" class="v21-empty">没有可编辑的版本。</div><template v-else><div class="v21-note">{{version.status==='draft'?`草稿 v${version.version}`:`v${version.version} 已发布。修改规则会创建新草稿。`}} · 支持单页 HTML、JSON 对象数组、列表到详情和分页列表。</div><div v-if="definition && !supportedDefinition" class="v21-error">此版本使用的节点超出 A06 工作台能力，请通过旧版界面查看；当前工作台只编辑通用记录的单页、JSON 或列表模板。</div><div v-if="definition && supportedDefinition" class="editor-grid"><div class="editor-form"><div class="v21-field"><label for="entry-url">入口 URL</label><input id="entry-url" v-model="definition.trigger.url" :disabled="version.status!=='draft'" placeholder="https://example.com/page" /></div><div class="v21-field"><label for="fetch-mode">获取方式</label><select id="fetch-mode" v-model="definition.trigger.fetch.mode" :disabled="version.status!=='draft'"><option value="http">Go HTTP</option><option value="browser">浏览器渲染</option></select></div><div v-if="definition.listing" class="v21-note">列表页发现详情，详情页写入记录；仅抓取入口同主机的链接。</div><div v-if="definition.listing" class="v21-field"><label>详情链接 CSS</label><input v-model="definition.listing.detail_selector" :disabled="version.status!=='draft'" placeholder="a.article-link[href]" /></div><div v-if="definition.listing" class="v21-field"><label>下一页 CSS</label><input v-model="definition.listing.next_selector" :disabled="version.status!=='draft'" placeholder="a[rel=next]，单页列表留空" /></div><div v-if="definition.listing" class="form-pair"><div class="v21-field"><label>最多列表页</label><input v-model.number="definition.listing.max_pages" type="number" min="1" max="100" :disabled="version.status!=='draft'" /></div><div class="v21-field"><label>连续空页停止</label><input v-model.number="definition.listing.max_empty_pages" type="number" min="1" max="10" :disabled="version.status!=='draft'" /></div></div><div v-if="isJSON" class="v21-field"><label for="items-path">数组路径</label><input id="items-path" v-model="definition.nodes[0].config.items_path" :disabled="version.status!=='draft'" placeholder="$.items" /></div><details v-if="definition.budget" class="v21-note"><summary>运行预算</summary><div class="form-pair"><div v-for="item in budgetFields" :key="item.key" class="v21-field"><label>{{item.label}}</label><input v-model.number="definition.budget[item.key]" type="number" min="1" :disabled="version.status!=='draft'" /></div></div><div class="v21-field"><label>允许域名（每行一个主机名）</label><textarea :value="definition.budget.allowed_domains.join('\n')" :disabled="version.status!=='draft'" @input="setAllowedDomains" /></div><small>按持久化任务和页面计数；重试不重置额度。域名必须包含入口主机。</small></details><h3>字段映射</h3><div v-for="(field,index) in fieldRules" :key="index" class="rule-row"><label :for="`selector-${index}`">{{field.name}} <span v-if="field.required">* 必填</span></label><input :id="`selector-${index}`" v-model="field.selector" :disabled="version.status!=='draft'" :placeholder="isJSON?'$.field':'CSS 选择器'" /><input v-if="!isJSON" v-model="field.attribute" :disabled="version.status!=='draft'" :aria-label="`${field.name} 属性`" placeholder="属性，可留空" /></div><section class="v21-note"><h3>JS 数据转换</h3><p>控制平面纯数据脚本；无 DOM、网络、文件或会话访问。脚本随采集器版本保存，发布前须回归全部样例。</p><el-button v-if="version.status==='draft'" @click="addScript">追加 JS 转换</el-button><div v-for="node in scriptNodes" :key="node.name" class="v21-field"><label>{{node.name}} · 版本 #{{version.id}}</label><label>输入字段（逗号分隔）</label><input :value="node.config.input_fields?.join(', ')" :disabled="version.status!=='draft'" @change="setScriptFields(node,'input_fields',$event)" /><label>输出字段（逗号分隔，返回完整对象）</label><input :value="node.config.output_fields?.join(', ')" :disabled="version.status!=='draft'" @change="setScriptFields(node,'output_fields',$event)" /><label>超时 ms（最多 2000）</label><input v-model.number="node.config.timeout_ms" type="number" min="1" max="2000" :disabled="version.status!=='draft'" /><textarea v-model="node.config.script" :disabled="version.status!=='draft'" aria-label="JavaScript 转换代码" /><el-button v-if="version.status==='draft'" text type="danger" @click="removeScript(node.name)">删除脚本</el-button></div></section><div class="v21-field"><label for="change-summary">变更摘要（保存新草稿时使用）</label><input id="change-summary" v-model="changeSummary" maxlength="500" placeholder="例如：修复标题选择器" /></div><div class="v21-actions"><el-button v-if="version.status==='draft'" :loading="busy" @click="saveDraft">保存规则为新草稿</el-button><el-button v-else @click="createDraft">创建编辑草稿</el-button><el-button @click="showJSON=!showJSON">{{showJSON?'隐藏':'高级'}} JSON 定义</el-button></div><div v-if="showJSON" class="v21-field json-editor"><label for="definition-json">工作流定义 JSON</label><textarea id="definition-json" v-model="definitionText" :disabled="version.status!=='draft'" @focus="jsonFocused=true" @blur="parseJSONEditor" /><small class="v21-muted">高级编辑与字段表单对应同一份定义；失焦时校验并同步。</small></div></div><div class="editor-preview"><h3>样例与预览</h3><p class="v21-muted">先保存草稿，再用样例验证。预览不会写正式记录或触发插件。</p><div class="v21-field"><label for="sample-source">样例来源</label><select id="sample-source" v-model="sampleSource" :disabled="version.status!=='draft'"><option value="live">实时获取</option><option value="paste">粘贴原文</option><option value="document">历史文档</option></select></div><div v-if="definition.listing" class="v21-field"><label>页面角色</label><select v-model="sampleRole" :disabled="version.status!=='draft'"><option value="list">列表页</option><option value="detail">详情页</option></select></div><div v-if="definition.listing && sampleRole==='detail'" class="v21-field"><label>详情页 URL</label><input v-model="samplePageURL" :disabled="version.status!=='draft'" placeholder="https://example.com/detail/1" /></div><div v-if="sampleSource==='paste'" class="v21-field"><label for="sample-content">{{isJSON?'JSON':'HTML'}} 原文</label><textarea id="sample-content" v-model="sampleContent" :disabled="version.status!=='draft'" placeholder="粘贴页面原文" /></div><div v-if="sampleSource==='document'" class="v21-field"><label for="document-id">历史文档 ID</label><input id="document-id" v-model.number="documentId" type="number" min="1" :disabled="version.status!=='draft'" /></div><div class="v21-field"><label for="sample-outcome">预期结果</label><select id="sample-outcome" v-model="sampleOutcome" :disabled="version.status!=='draft'"><option value="success">正常提取</option><option value="error">预期字段或校验错误</option><option v-if="definition.listing && sampleRole==='list'" value="empty_list">空列表且无下一页</option></select></div><div v-if="sampleOutcome==='error'" class="v21-field"><label for="sample-expected-error">错误包含文字</label><input id="sample-expected-error" v-model="sampleExpectedError" :disabled="version.status!=='draft'" placeholder="例如 required field" /></div><div class="v21-actions"><el-button :disabled="version.status!=='draft'" :loading="busy" @click="saveSample">保存样例</el-button><el-button :disabled="!samples.length" :loading="busy" @click="checkSamples">回归全部样例</el-button></div><div v-if="!samples.length" class="v21-empty">当前版本还没有样例。保存至少一个样例后才能发布。</div><div v-for="sample in samples" :key="sample.id" class="v21-row"><div><strong>{{sample.note||`${sample.source} 样例 #${sample.id}`}}</strong><small>{{sample.page_role}} · {{sample.expected_outcome==='error'?'预期报错':sample.expected_outcome==='empty_list'?'预期空列表':'正常提取'}} · {{sample.content_type}} · {{sample.page_url}}</small></div><div class="v21-actions"><el-button text @click="previewSample(sample.id)">预览</el-button><el-button v-if="version.status==='draft'" text type="danger" @click="deleteSample(sample.id)">删除</el-button></div></div></div></div></template></template>
    <template v-if="activeTab==='preview'"><div class="preview-head"><div><h3>完整 dry-run</h3><p class="v21-muted">{{preview?.fetched_live?'本次访问网络':'使用保存的样例快照，未访问网络'}} · 不写正式数据</p></div><el-button :disabled="!samples.length||busy" :loading="busy" @click="checkSamples">回归样例</el-button></div><p v-if="checkError" class="v21-error" role="alert">{{checkError}}</p><section v-if="checks.length" class="sample-checks"><h3>样例回归 · {{checks.filter(item=>item.passed).length}} / {{checks.length}} 通过</h3><button v-for="item in checks" :key="item.sample_id" class="check-item" :class="{active:preview===item}" @click="preview=item"><span><strong>{{samples.find(sample=>sample.id===item.sample_id)?.note||`样例 #${item.sample_id}`}}</strong><small>{{item.error||'查看字段与保存决策'}}</small></span><span class="v21-status" :class="item.passed?'ok':'bad'">{{item.passed?'通过':'失败'}}</span></button></section><div v-if="!preview" class="v21-empty">在“配置与样例”中选择样例预览，查看每一步和预计保存决策。</div><template v-else><h3 v-if="preview.sample_id">样例 #{{preview.sample_id}} · {{preview.passed?'通过':'失败'}}</h3><p class="v21-note">预期：{{preview.expected_outcome}} · 实际：{{preview.actual_outcome}}</p><p v-if="preview.actual_error" class="v21-note">实际错误：{{preview.actual_error}}</p><p v-if="preview.error" class="v21-error">{{preview.error}}</p><div v-for="(step,index) in preview.steps" :key="index" class="step-card"><div><span class="v21-status">{{step.type}}</span><strong>{{step.node}}</strong><small>候选 {{step.candidate+1}}</small></div><p v-if="step.error" class="v21-error">{{step.error}}</p><div v-for="field in step.fields||[]" :key="field.rule_path" class="v21-note"><strong>{{field.name}}</strong> · {{field.rule_path}} · {{field.selector}} · 命中 {{field.match_count}}<br>原值：{{display(field.raw)}} → 转换值：{{display(field.converted)}}<span v-if="field.error" class="v21-error"> · {{field.error}}</span></div><dl><template v-for="(value,key) in step.values" :key="key"><dt>{{key}}</dt><dd>{{display(value)}}</dd></template></dl></div><div v-if="preview.page_role==='list'" class="v21-note">发现详情 {{preview.discovered_urls?.length||0}} 条；下一页：{{preview.next_url||'无'}}。列表样例不会写入记录，请另存详情样例。</div><h3 v-else>预计保存决策</h3><div v-for="decision in preview.decisions" :key="decision.index" class="v21-row"><div><strong>{{decision.canonical_key||`候选 ${decision.index+1}`}}</strong><small>{{decision.reason||display(decision.values||{})}}</small></div><span class="v21-status" :class="decision.decision==='invalid'||decision.decision==='conflict'?'bad':decision.decision==='created'?'ok':'warn'">{{decision.decision}}</span></div></template></template>
    <template v-if="activeTab==='versions'"><h3>版本历史</h3><div v-for="item in versions" :key="item.id" class="v21-row"><div><strong>v{{item.version}} · {{item.status}}</strong><small>{{formatDate(item.created_at)}} · 版本 #{{item.id}} · {{item.change_summary||'无变更摘要'}}</small></div><el-button text @click="openVersion(item)">查看</el-button><el-button v-if="item.status!=='draft'" text @click="rollbackToDraft(item)">复制为草稿</el-button></div><div v-if="version && versions.length>1" class="v21-note"><div class="v21-field"><label for="compare-base">对比样例版本</label><select id="compare-base" v-model.number="compareBase"><option v-for="item in versions" :key="item.id" :value="item.id">v{{item.version}}</option></select></div><el-button :loading="compareBusy" @click="compareVersionSamples">对比 v{{version.version}} 与所选版本</el-button></div><div v-if="comparison" class="v21-note"><strong>{{comparison.samples.length}} 个样例，{{comparison.changed}} 个结果变化</strong><div v-for="item in comparison.samples" :key="item.sample_id" class="v21-row"><div><strong>样例 #{{item.sample_id}} · {{item.changed?'有差异':'一致'}}</strong><small>结果 {{item.left.actual_outcome}} → {{item.right.actual_outcome}} · 保存决策 {{item.left.decisions.map(d=>d.decision).join(', ')}} → {{item.right.decisions.map(d=>d.decision).join(', ')}}</small><small v-for="field in item.fields" :key="field.candidate+field.field">候选 {{field.candidate+1}} · {{field.field}}：{{display(field.left)}} → {{display(field.right)}}</small></div></div></div></template>
    <template v-if="activeTab==='quality'"><h3>采集质量趋势</h3><div v-if="!quality?.has_baseline" class="v21-note">尚无基线。完成有记录或必填字段诊断的运行后显示质量指标。</div><p v-if="quality?.issue" class="v21-error">{{quality.issue}}</p><p class="v21-muted">按最近 10 次结束运行统计。必填缺失与异常率按页面计；唯一键生成率按成功记录数与必填缺失数估算。</p><div class="form-pair"><div class="v21-field"><label>最低唯一键生成率（0–1）</label><input v-model.number="qualityThreshold.min_key_rate" type="number" min="0" max="1" step="0.01" /></div><div class="v21-field"><label>最大必填缺失率（0–1）</label><input v-model.number="qualityThreshold.max_required_missing_rate" type="number" min="0" max="1" step="0.01" /></div><div class="v21-field"><label>最大异常率（0–1）</label><input v-model.number="qualityThreshold.max_anomaly_rate" type="number" min="0" max="1" step="0.01" /></div></div><el-button :loading="busy" @click="saveQuality">保存阈值</el-button><details class="v21-note"><summary>原文与截图保留预览</summary><p>预览统计全平台文档；清理默认关闭，部署前需备份并设置 RETENTION_DOCUMENT_DAYS。</p><div class="v21-field"><label for="retention-days">保留天数</label><input id="retention-days" v-model.number="retentionDays" type="number" min="1" max="3650" /></div><el-button @click="previewRetention">查看可清理量</el-button><p v-if="retentionPreview">可清理 {{retentionPreview.eligible}} 份（{{retentionPreview.bytes}} 字节）；因样例、记录或任务追溯保留 {{retentionPreview.protected}} 份。</p></details><div v-for="run in quality?.runs||[]" :key="run.run_id" class="v21-row"><div><strong>运行 #{{run.run_id}} · {{run.status}}</strong><small>{{formatDate(run.created_at)}} · {{run.pages}} 页 · {{run.records}} 条记录</small><small>必填缺失 {{percent(run.required_missing_rate)}} · 唯一键生成 {{percent(run.key_rate)}} · 异常 {{percent(run.anomaly_rate)}}</small></div><router-link class="v21-link" :to="{path:'/workspace/runs',query:{id:String(run.run_id)}}">检查 →</router-link></div></template><template v-if="activeTab==='schedule'"><h3>定时与 API 触发</h3><p class="v21-note">定时配置持久保存，服务重启后自动恢复。API 触发需登录令牌，当前只接受采集器 ID，不允许覆盖运行参数或凭据。</p><div class="editor-grid"><div class="editor-form"><div class="v21-field"><label>启用定时</label><el-switch v-model="scheduleForm.enabled" :disabled="!selectedWorkflow.published_version_id" /></div><div class="v21-field"><label>Cron（五段，分 时 日 月 周）</label><input v-model="scheduleForm.cron" placeholder="0 9 * * *" /></div><div class="v21-field"><label>时区</label><input v-model="scheduleForm.timezone" placeholder="Asia/Shanghai" /></div><div class="v21-field"><label>并发策略</label><select v-model="scheduleForm.concurrency_policy"><option value="skip">跳过：已有运行时记跳过</option><option value="queue">排队：等已有运行结束</option></select></div><el-button type="primary" :loading="busy" @click="saveSchedule">保存定时配置</el-button></div><div class="editor-preview"><h3>调度状态</h3><p>下一次：{{formatDate(schedule?.next_run_at)}}</p><p>上一次：{{formatDate(schedule?.last_run_at)}}</p><p>API：POST /api/v2/workflows/run/api</p><pre class="json-box">{"workflow_id": {{selectedWorkflow.id}}}</pre><h3>最近触发</h3><div v-if="!scheduleEvents.length" class="v21-empty">暂无定时触发。</div><div v-for="event in scheduleEvents" :key="event.id" class="v21-row"><span>{{formatDate(event.scheduled_at)}} · {{event.status}} {{event.reason}}</span><router-link v-if="event.run_id" class="v21-link" :to="{path:'/workspace/runs',query:{id:String(event.run_id)}}">运行 #{{event.run_id}}</router-link></div></div></div></template>
    <template v-if="activeTab==='runs'"><h3>最近运行</h3><div v-if="!collectorRuns.length" class="v21-empty">此采集器尚未正式运行。</div><div v-for="run in collectorRuns" :key="run.id" class="v21-row"><div><strong>{{run.status}} · 运行 #{{run.id}}</strong><small>{{formatDate(run.created_at)}} · {{triggerName(run.trigger_type)}} · 版本 #{{run.workflow_version_id}}</small></div><router-link class="v21-link" :to="{path:'/workspace/runs',query:{id:String(run.id)}}">查看任务 →</router-link></div></template>
   </template></section></div>
  <el-dialog v-model="wizardOpen" title="添加来源" width="min(850px,96vw)" :close-on-click-modal="false"><div class="wizard-steps"><span v-for="(label,index) in wizardLabels" :key="label" :class="{active:index===wizardStep}">{{index+1}} {{label}}</span></div><div v-if="wizardStep===0"><p>选择目标数据集。同类记录将按唯一键合并，保留各自来源。</p><div class="v21-field"><label for="wizard-dataset">目标数据集</label><select id="wizard-dataset" v-model.number="wizard.datasetId"><option v-for="dataset in datasets" :key="dataset.id" :value="dataset.id">{{dataset.name}}</option></select></div></div><div v-if="wizardStep===1"><div class="v21-field"><label for="wizard-name">采集器名称</label><input id="wizard-name" v-model="wizard.name" placeholder="例如：站点文章详情" /></div><div class="v21-field"><label for="wizard-url">目标 URL</label><input id="wizard-url" v-model="wizard.url" placeholder="https://example.com/page" /></div><div class="v21-field"><label for="wizard-template">页面类型</label><select id="wizard-template" v-model="wizard.templateCode"><option v-for="template in templates" :key="template.code" :value="template.code">{{template.name}} · {{template.description}}</option></select></div><p class="v21-note">列表模板先预览列表链接，创建后还需保存一份详情页样例才能发布。</p></div><div v-if="wizardStep===2"><div class="v21-field"><label for="wizard-sample-source">样例来源</label><select id="wizard-sample-source" v-model="wizardSampleSource"><option value="live">实时获取目标 URL</option><option value="paste">粘贴原文</option></select></div><div v-if="wizardSampleSource==='paste'" class="v21-field"><label for="wizard-sample-content">页面或 JSON 原文</label><textarea id="wizard-sample-content" v-model="wizardSampleContent" placeholder="粘贴完整 HTML 或 JSON" /></div><p class="v21-note">样例会绑定草稿版本；预览不会写入正式记录。</p></div><div v-if="wizardStep===3"><p>按数据集字段设置 {{wizard.templateCode==='json_api'?'JSONPath':'CSS'}} 提取规则。必填字段和唯一键必须能提取。</p><div v-if="wizardRule?.listing" class="v21-field"><label>详情链接 CSS</label><input v-model="wizardRule.listing.detail_selector" placeholder="a.article-link[href]" /></div><div v-if="wizardRule?.listing" class="v21-field"><label>下一页 CSS</label><input v-model="wizardRule.listing.next_selector" placeholder="单页列表留空" /></div><div v-if="wizardRule?.listing" class="form-pair"><div class="v21-field"><label>最多列表页</label><input v-model.number="wizardRule.listing.max_pages" type="number" min="1" max="100" /></div><div class="v21-field"><label>连续空页停止</label><input v-model.number="wizardRule.listing.max_empty_pages" type="number" min="1" max="10" /></div></div><div v-if="wizard.templateCode==='json_api'&&wizardRule" class="v21-field"><label for="wizard-items-path">JSON 对象数组路径</label><input id="wizard-items-path" v-model="wizardRule.nodes[0].config.items_path" placeholder="$.items 或 $" /></div><div v-for="(field,index) in wizardFields" :key="index" class="v21-field"><label :for="`wizard-field-${index}`">{{field.name}}{{field.required?' · 必填':''}}{{field.multiple?' · 多值':''}}</label><input :id="`wizard-field-${index}`" v-model="field.selector" :placeholder="wizard.templateCode==='json_api'?'$.field':'CSS 选择器'" /><input v-if="wizard.templateCode!=='json_api'" v-model="field.attribute" :aria-label="`${field.name} 提取属性`" placeholder="属性，例如 href；留空提取文本" /></div></div><div v-if="wizardStep===4"><p>将创建草稿、保存样例并运行完整预览。请在预览结果中核对每一步及预计保存动作，再发布版本。</p><div class="v21-note">目标：{{wizard.url}}<br>数据集：{{datasetName(wizard.datasetId)}}<br>字段数：{{wizardFields.length}}<br>样例：{{wizardSampleSource==='live'?'实时获取':'粘贴原文'}}</div></div><template #footer><el-button @click="wizardOpen=false">取消</el-button><el-button v-if="wizardStep>0" @click="wizardStep--">上一步</el-button><el-button v-if="wizardStep<4" type="primary" @click="wizardNext">下一步</el-button><el-button v-else type="primary" :loading="busy" @click="createWorkflow">创建并预览</el-button></template></el-dialog>
 </div>
</template>
<script setup lang="ts">
import { computed,onMounted,reactive,ref,watch } from 'vue';
import { useRoute,useRouter } from 'vue-router';
import { ElMessage,ElMessageBox } from 'element-plus';
import { api,errorText,workflowPages,type Dataset,type DatasetField,type Definition,type AIPrepared,type AISuggestion,type PluginCapability,type PluginSubscription,type PluginTaskRow,type Preview,type QualityTrend,type Run,type Sample,type SampleOutcome,type Schedule,type ScheduleEvent,type Template,type Version,type VersionSampleComparison,type Workflow } from './api';
import { projectId } from './state';
import { datasetDefinition,editableDefinition } from './rules';
const route=useRoute(),router=useRouter();const allDatasets=ref<Dataset[]>([]),allWorkflows=ref<Workflow[]>([]),templates=ref<Template[]>([]),versions=ref<Version[]>([]),samples=ref<Sample[]>([]),collectorRuns=ref<Run[]>([]),selectedId=ref(0),version=ref<Version|null>(null),definition=ref<Definition|null>(null),preview=ref<Preview|null>(null),activeTab=ref('editor'),loading=ref(false),busy=ref(false),error=ref(''),showJSON=ref(false),definitionText=ref(''),savedDefinition=ref('');
const checks=ref<Preview[]>([]),checkError=ref('');
const compareBase=ref(0),comparison=ref<VersionSampleComparison|null>(null),compareBusy=ref(false);
const quality=ref<QualityTrend|null>(null);
const qualityThreshold=reactive({min_key_rate:0.95,max_required_missing_rate:0.05,max_anomaly_rate:0.10});
const ownerName=ref(''),changeSummary=ref('');
const aiSuggestions=ref<AISuggestion[]>([]),aiPrepared=ref<AIPrepared|null>(null),aiSampleId=ref(0),aiConsent=ref(false),aiFailure=ref('');
function aiResult(item:AISuggestion){return typeof item.result==='string'?JSON.parse(item.result):item.result;}
async function loadAI(id:number){try{aiSuggestions.value=(await api.aiList(id)).list||[];}catch(e){ElMessage.error(errorText(e));}}
async function prepareAI(){if(!version.value||!aiSampleId.value)return;busy.value=true;try{aiPrepared.value=await api.aiPrepare(version.value.id,aiSampleId.value);aiConsent.value=false;}catch(e){ElMessage.error(errorText(e));}finally{busy.value=false;}}
async function suggestAI(){if(!version.value||!aiPrepared.value||!aiConsent.value)return;busy.value=true;try{await api.aiSuggest(version.value.id,aiPrepared.value.sample_id,aiFailure.value);await loadAI(version.value.id);aiConsent.value=false;ElMessage.success('建议已生成，等待人工审核');}catch(e){ElMessage.error(errorText(e));}finally{busy.value=false;}}
async function reviewAI(item:AISuggestion,decision:'accepted'|'rejected'){if(!version.value||!definition.value||item.version_id!==version.value.id)return;try{await api.aiReview(item.id,version.value.id,decision);if(decision==='accepted'){for(const suggestion of aiResult(item).suggestions||[]){const field=fieldRules.value.find(field=>field.name===suggestion.field);if(field){field.selector=suggestion.selector;field.attribute=suggestion.attribute||'';}}ElMessage.success('建议已填入当前编辑器，请保存新草稿并回归样例');}await loadAI(version.value.id);}catch(e){ElMessage.error(errorText(e));}}

const pluginSubscriptions=ref<PluginSubscription[]>([]),pluginCapabilities=ref<PluginCapability[]>([]),pluginTasks=ref<PluginTaskRow[]>([]),pluginFields=ref<DatasetField[]>([]);
const pluginForm=reactive({plugin_code:'',event_type:'record.created' as 'record.created'|'record.updated',url_field:'',scope:'workflow',enabled:false});
async function loadPlugins(id:number,datasetId?:number){if(!datasetId)return;try{const [subs,caps,tasks,schema]=await Promise.all([api.pluginSubscriptions(datasetId,id),api.pluginCapabilities(),api.pluginTasks(id),api.dataset(datasetId)]);if(selectedId.value!==id)return;pluginSubscriptions.value=subs.list||[];pluginCapabilities.value=caps.list||[];pluginTasks.value=tasks.list||[];pluginFields.value=(schema.fields||[]).filter(field=>!field.multiple&&['url','string'].includes(field.field_type));if(!pluginCapabilities.value.some(x=>x.code===pluginForm.plugin_code))pluginForm.plugin_code=pluginCapabilities.value[0]?.code||'';if(!pluginFields.value.some(x=>x.field_key===pluginForm.url_field))pluginForm.url_field=pluginFields.value[0]?.field_key||'';}catch(e){ElMessage.error(errorText(e));}}
async function savePluginSubscription(){if(!selectedWorkflow.value?.dataset_id)return;busy.value=true;try{await api.savePluginSubscription({dataset_id:selectedWorkflow.value.dataset_id,workflow_id:pluginForm.scope==='workflow'?selectedWorkflow.value.id:undefined,plugin_code:pluginForm.plugin_code,event_type:pluginForm.event_type,url_field:pluginForm.url_field,enabled:pluginForm.enabled});await loadPlugins(selectedWorkflow.value.id,selectedWorkflow.value.dataset_id);ElMessage.success('订阅已保存');}catch(e){ElMessage.error(errorText(e));}finally{busy.value=false;}}
async function togglePluginSubscription(item:PluginSubscription){busy.value=true;try{await api.savePluginSubscription({...item,enabled:!item.enabled});await loadPlugins(selectedId.value,item.dataset_id);}catch(e){ElMessage.error(errorText(e));}finally{busy.value=false;}}
async function retryPluginTask(id:number){try{await api.retryPluginTask(id);if(selectedWorkflow.value)await loadPlugins(selectedId.value,selectedWorkflow.value.dataset_id);}catch(e){ElMessage.error(errorText(e));}}
async function cancelPluginTask(id:number){try{await api.cancelPluginTask(id);if(selectedWorkflow.value)await loadPlugins(selectedId.value,selectedWorkflow.value.dataset_id);}catch(e){ElMessage.error(errorText(e));}}
async function deletePluginSubscription(item:PluginSubscription){busy.value=true;try{await api.deletePluginSubscription(item.dataset_id,item.id);await loadPlugins(selectedId.value,item.dataset_id);}catch(e){ElMessage.error(errorText(e));}finally{busy.value=false;}}
const retentionDays=ref(90),retentionPreview=ref<{cutoff:string;eligible:number;protected:number;bytes:number}|null>(null);
async function previewRetention(){try{retentionPreview.value=await api.documentRetentionPreview(retentionDays.value);}catch(e){ElMessage.error(errorText(e));}}
const schedule=ref<Schedule|null>(null),scheduleEvents=ref<ScheduleEvent[]>([]),scheduleForm=reactive({cron:'0 9 * * *',timezone:'Asia/Shanghai',enabled:false,concurrency_policy:'skip' as 'skip'|'queue'});
const sampleSource=ref('live'),sampleRole=ref('trigger'),samplePageURL=ref(''),sampleContent=ref(''),documentId=ref<number|undefined>(),sampleOutcome=ref<SampleOutcome>('success'),sampleExpectedError=ref(''),wizardOpen=ref(false),wizardStep=ref(0),wizardLabels=['目标数据','来源与模板','获取样例','定义输出','预览与发布'],wizardSampleSource=ref('live'),wizardSampleContent=ref(''),wizardRule=ref<Definition|null>(null),jsonFocused=ref(false);
const wizard=reactive({datasetId:0,name:'',url:'',templateCode:'single_page'});
const repairTask=computed(()=>Number(route.query.repair_task)||0);
function applyRepairContext(){if(!repairTask.value||Number(route.query.id)!==selectedId.value||!definition.value)return;const document=Number(route.query.repair_document)||0;sampleSource.value=document?'document':'live';documentId.value=document||undefined;const role=String(route.query.repair_role||'trigger');sampleRole.value=definition.value.listing&&(role==='list'||role==='detail')?role:'trigger';const url=String(route.query.repair_url||'');if(/^https?:\/\//.test(url))samplePageURL.value=url;activeTab.value='editor';}
const datasets=computed(()=>allDatasets.value.filter(d=>d.project_id===projectId.value));const workflows=computed(()=>allWorkflows.value.filter(w=>w.project_id===projectId.value));const selectedWorkflow=computed(()=>workflows.value.find(w=>w.id===selectedId.value));const fieldRules=computed<any[]>(()=>definition.value?.nodes.find(n=>n.type==='extract')?.config.fields||[]);const isJSON=computed(()=>definition.value?.nodes[0]?.config.content_type==='json');const wizardFields=computed<any[]>(()=>wizardRule.value?.nodes[0]?.config.fields||[]);const tabs=[{id:'editor',name:'配置与样例'},{id:'preview',name:'预览结果'},{id:'quality',name:'质量'},{id:'plugins',name:'插件订阅'},{id:'ai',name:'AI 辅助'},{id:'schedule',name:'触发器'},{id:'runs',name:'运行'},{id:'versions',name:'版本'}];
function percent(value:number){return `${(value*100).toFixed(1)}%`;}
async function loadQuality(id:number){try{const result=await api.quality(id);if(selectedId.value!==id)return;quality.value=result;Object.assign(qualityThreshold,result.threshold);}catch(e){ElMessage.error(errorText(e));}}
async function saveQuality(){if(!selectedId.value)return;busy.value=true;try{await api.saveQuality({workflow_id:selectedId.value,...qualityThreshold});await loadQuality(selectedId.value);ElMessage.success('质量阈值已保存');}catch(e){ElMessage.error(errorText(e));}finally{busy.value=false;}}
async function saveOwner(){if(!selectedId.value)return;busy.value=true;try{await api.updateWorkflowOwner(selectedId.value,ownerName.value);if(selectedWorkflow.value)selectedWorkflow.value.owner_name=ownerName.value;ElMessage.success('负责人已保存');}catch(e){ElMessage.error(errorText(e));}finally{busy.value=false;}}
const budgetFields=[{key:'max_discovered_per_page',label:'每页最多发现'},{key:'max_tasks',label:'最多任务'},{key:'max_pages',label:'最多页面'},{key:'max_depth',label:'最大深度'},{key:'max_duration_seconds',label:'最长运行秒数'},{key:'max_domains',label:'最多域名'}];
function setAllowedDomains(event:Event){if(definition.value?.budget)definition.value.budget.allowed_domains=(event.target as HTMLTextAreaElement).value.split(/\r?\n/).map(v=>v.trim()).filter(Boolean);}
const dirty=computed(()=>!!definition.value&&JSON.stringify(definition.value)!==savedDefinition.value);
const supportedDefinition=computed(()=>definition.value?.persistence==='records'&&definition.value?.nodes?.[0]?.type==='extract'&&definition.value.nodes.filter(node=>node.type==='extract').length===1&&definition.value.nodes.every(node=>['extract','transform','validate','script'].includes(node.type)));
function datasetName(id?:number){return datasets.value.find(d=>d.id===id)?.name||'未关联数据集';}function display(value:any){return typeof value==='string'?value:JSON.stringify(value);}function formatDate(value?:string){return value?new Date(value).toLocaleString():'—';}
function cloneDefinition(raw:Definition):Definition{return JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(raw));}
const scriptNodes=computed(()=>definition.value?.nodes.filter(node=>node.type==='script')||[]);
function addScript(){if(!definition.value||version.value?.status!=='draft')return;const fields=fieldRules.value.map(field=>field.name);definition.value.nodes.push({name:`script_${Date.now().toString(36)}`,type:'script',config:{script:'return input;',timeout_ms:500,input_fields:fields,output_fields:fields}});}
function setScriptFields(node:Definition['nodes'][number],key:string,event:Event){node.config[key]=(event.target as HTMLInputElement).value.split(',').map(field=>field.trim()).filter(Boolean);}
function removeScript(name:string){if(definition.value)definition.value.nodes=definition.value.nodes.filter(node=>node.name!==name);}
function triggerName(value:string){return ({manual:'手动',cron:'定时',api:'API'} as Record<string,string>)[value]||value;}
async function loadSchedule(id:number){const result=await api.schedule(id);if(selectedId.value!==id)return;schedule.value=result.schedule;scheduleEvents.value=result.events||[];Object.assign(scheduleForm,{cron:result.schedule?.cron||'0 9 * * *',timezone:result.schedule?.timezone||'Asia/Shanghai',enabled:result.schedule?.enabled||false,concurrency_policy:result.schedule?.concurrency_policy||'skip'});}
async function saveSchedule(){if(!selectedWorkflow.value)return;busy.value=true;try{schedule.value=await api.saveSchedule({workflow_id:selectedWorkflow.value.id,...scheduleForm});await loadSchedule(selectedWorkflow.value.id);ElMessage.success('定时配置已保存');}catch(e){ElMessage.error(errorText(e));}finally{busy.value=false;}}
function parseDefinition(raw:string|Definition):Definition {return editableDefinition(raw);}
function useVersion(item:Version){version.value=item;definition.value=parseDefinition(item.definition);if(!definition.value.budget){let host='';try{host=new URL(definition.value.trigger.url).hostname.toLowerCase();}catch{}definition.value.budget={max_discovered_per_page:100,max_tasks:1000,max_pages:500,max_depth:100,max_duration_seconds:1800,max_domains:1,allowed_domains:host?[host]:[]};}sampleRole.value=definition.value.listing?'list':'trigger';sampleOutcome.value='success';sampleExpectedError.value='';samplePageURL.value=definition.value.trigger.url;compareBase.value=item.id;comparison.value=null;savedDefinition.value=JSON.stringify(definition.value);definitionText.value=JSON.stringify(definition.value,null,2);preview.value=null;checks.value=[];checkError.value='';loadSamples();loadAI(item.id);aiPrepared.value=null;aiSampleId.value=0;aiConsent.value=false;applyRepairContext();}
function openVersion(item:Version){useVersion(item);activeTab.value='editor';router.replace({path:'/workspace/collectors',query:{id:String(item.workflow_id),version:String(item.id)}});}
async function load(){loading.value=true;error.value='';try{const [d,w,t]=await Promise.all([api.datasets(),projectId.value?workflowPages(projectId.value):Promise.resolve([]),api.templates()]);allDatasets.value=d||[];allWorkflows.value=w||[];templates.value=t.list||[];const id=Number(route.query.id)||selectedId.value;if(workflows.value.some(w=>w.id===id))await selectWorkflow(id);else if(workflows.value.length)await selectWorkflow(workflows.value[0].id);else {selectedId.value=0;version.value=null;definition.value=null;samples.value=[];collectorRuns.value=[];}if(route.query.create==='1'&&datasets.value.length&&!wizardOpen.value)startWizard();}catch(e){error.value=errorText(e);}finally{loading.value=false;}}
async function selectWorkflow(id:number){if(!workflows.value.some(item=>item.id===id))return;selectedId.value=id;activeTab.value=route.query.tab==='quality'?'quality':'editor';preview.value=null;const [detail,history]=await Promise.all([api.workflow(id),api.workflowRuns(id)]);if(!workflows.value.some(item=>item.id===id)||detail.workflow.project_id!==projectId.value)return;ownerName.value=detail.workflow.owner_name||'';collectorRuns.value=history.list||[];await loadSchedule(id);await loadQuality(id);await loadPlugins(id,detail.workflow.dataset_id);versions.value=detail.versions||[];const draft=versions.value.filter(v=>v.status==='draft').sort((a,b)=>b.version-a.version)[0];const published=versions.value.find(v=>v.id===detail.workflow.published_version_id);const requested=versions.value.find(v=>v.id===Number(route.query.version));const selected=repairTask.value&&Number(route.query.id)===id?draft||published:requested||draft||published||versions.value[versions.value.length-1];if(selected)useVersion(selected);else{version.value=null;definition.value=null;}if(route.query.tab==='quality')activeTab.value='quality';if(Number(route.query.id)!==id)router.replace({path:'/workspace/collectors',query:{...route.query,id:String(id),...(requested?{version:String(requested.id)}:{})}});}
async function loadSamples(){if(!version.value){samples.value=[];return;}try{samples.value=(await api.sampleList(version.value.id)).list||[];}catch(e){error.value=errorText(e);}}
let wizardRuleRequest=0;
function startWizard(){wizard.datasetId=datasets.value[0]?.id||0;wizard.name='';wizard.url='';wizard.templateCode=templates.value[0]?.code||'single_page';wizardSampleSource.value='live';wizardSampleContent.value='';wizardStep.value=0;wizardOpen.value=true;refreshWizardRule();}
async function refreshWizardRule(){const requestId=++wizardRuleRequest;wizardRule.value=null;const template=templates.value.find(t=>t.code===wizard.templateCode);if(!template||!wizard.datasetId)return;try{const schema=await api.dataset(wizard.datasetId);if(requestId!==wizardRuleRequest)return;wizardRule.value=datasetDefinition(template,schema.fields);}catch(e){if(requestId===wizardRuleRequest)ElMessage.error(errorText(e));}}
function wizardNext(){if(!wizardRule.value){ElMessage.warning('请等待数据集字段加载完成');return;}if(wizardStep.value===1&&(!wizard.name.trim()||!/^https?:\/\//.test(wizard.url))){ElMessage.warning('请填写名称和 HTTP(S) URL');return;}if(wizardStep.value===2&&wizardSampleSource.value==='paste'&&!wizardSampleContent.value.trim()){ElMessage.warning('请粘贴样例原文');return;}if(wizardStep.value===3&&wizard.templateCode==='json_api'&&!wizardRule.value.nodes[0].config.items_path?.trim()){ElMessage.warning('请填写 JSON 对象数组路径');return;}if(wizardStep.value===3&&wizardRule.value.listing&&(!wizardRule.value.listing.detail_selector.trim()||wizardRule.value.listing.max_pages<1||wizardRule.value.listing.max_pages>100||wizardRule.value.listing.max_empty_pages<1||wizardRule.value.listing.max_empty_pages>10)){ElMessage.warning('请填写有效的列表选择器和页数上限');return;}if(wizardStep.value===3&&wizardFields.value.some(f=>!f.selector?.trim())){ElMessage.warning('请填写所有字段选择器');return;}wizardStep.value=Math.min(4,wizardStep.value+1);}
async function createWorkflow(){const dataset=datasets.value.find(d=>d.id===wizard.datasetId);if(!wizardRule.value||!dataset){ElMessage.error('请选择模板与数据集');return;}const rule=cloneDefinition(wizardRule.value);rule.trigger.url=wizard.url.trim();busy.value=true;let created=false;try{const host=new URL(wizard.url).host;const result=await api.createWorkflow({project_id:projectId.value,dataset_id:dataset.id,source:host,source_name:host,code:`source_${Date.now().toString(36)}_${Math.random().toString(36).slice(2,6)}`,name:wizard.name.trim(),resource_type:dataset.record_type,definition:JSON.stringify(rule)});created=true;wizardOpen.value=false;await router.replace({path:'/workspace/collectors',query:{id:String(result.workflow.id)}});await load();const sample=await api.sampleCreate({version_id:result.version.id,source:wizardSampleSource.value,page_role:rule.listing?'list':'trigger',page_url:rule.trigger.url,content_type:wizard.templateCode==='json_api'?'json':'html',content:wizardSampleSource.value==='paste'?wizardSampleContent.value:undefined,note:rule.listing?'首次使用向导列表样例':'首次使用向导样例'});await loadSamples();await previewSample(sample.id);ElMessage.success(rule.listing?'列表样例已预览；请再保存一份详情样例后发布':'样例预览已完成；核对结果后发布');}catch(e){ElMessage.error(`${errorText(e)}${created?'。采集器草稿已保留，可在工作台继续配置':''}`);}finally{busy.value=false;}}
function parseJSONEditor(){jsonFocused.value=false;if(!definition.value)return;try{const candidate=editableDefinition(definitionText.value);if(candidate.persistence!=='records'||candidate.nodes[0]?.type!=='extract'||candidate.nodes.filter(node=>node.type==='extract').length!==1||candidate.nodes.some(node=>!['extract','transform','validate','script'].includes(node.type)))throw new Error('工作台只编辑一个 extract 及后续 transform/validate/script 的通用记录定义');definition.value=candidate;ElMessage.success('JSON 定义已同步到字段表单');}catch(e){ElMessage.error(errorText(e));definitionText.value=JSON.stringify(definition.value,null,2);}}
async function persistDraft(){if(!selectedWorkflow.value||!definition.value)return false;busy.value=true;try{const next=await api.createVersion(selectedWorkflow.value.id,JSON.stringify(definition.value),version.value?.id||0,changeSummary.value.trim());await selectWorkflow(selectedWorkflow.value.id);useVersion(next);changeSummary.value='';ElMessage.success('新草稿已保存；请重新保存并回归样例');return true;}catch(e){ElMessage.error(errorText(e));return false;}finally{busy.value=false;}}
async function saveDraft(){if(version.value?.status==='draft'&&samples.value.length){try{await ElMessageBox.confirm('保存规则会创建新版本，现有样例不会自动继承。继续吗？','创建新草稿');}catch{return;}}await persistDraft();}
async function createDraft(){await persistDraft();}
async function compareVersionSamples(){if(!version.value||!compareBase.value)return;compareBusy.value=true;try{comparison.value=await api.compareSamples(compareBase.value,version.value.id,compareBase.value);ElMessage.success('离线样例比较完成');}catch(e){ElMessage.error(errorText(e));}finally{compareBusy.value=false;}}
async function rollbackToDraft(item:Version){try{await ElMessageBox.confirm(`将 v${item.version} 的规则和样例复制为新草稿。历史运行不会修改，发布仍需回归确认。`,'从历史版本创建草稿');const draft=await api.rollbackVersion(item.id);await selectWorkflow(item.workflow_id);useVersion(draft);ElMessage.success('历史版本已复制为草稿，请回归样例后发布');}catch(e){if(e!=='cancel')ElMessage.error(errorText(e));}}
async function saveSample(){if(!version.value||version.value.status!=='draft')return;if(dirty.value){ElMessage.warning('规则有未保存的修改，请先保存新草稿');return;}if(sampleSource.value==='paste'&&!sampleContent.value.trim()){ElMessage.warning('请粘贴页面原文');return;}if(sampleSource.value==='document'&&!documentId.value){ElMessage.warning('请填写历史文档 ID');return;}if(definition.value?.listing&&sampleRole.value==='detail'&&!/^https?:\/\//.test(samplePageURL.value)){ElMessage.warning('请填写同站点详情页 URL');return;}if(sampleOutcome.value==='error'&&!sampleExpectedError.value.trim()){ElMessage.warning('请填写预期错误包含的文字');return;}busy.value=true;try{const sample=await api.sampleCreate({version_id:version.value.id,source:sampleSource.value,page_role:sampleRole.value,content_type:isJSON.value?'json':'html',content:sampleSource.value==='paste'?sampleContent.value:undefined,document_id:sampleSource.value==='document'?documentId.value:undefined,page_url:samplePageURL.value||definition.value?.trigger.url,expected_outcome:sampleOutcome.value,expected_error:sampleOutcome.value==='error'?sampleExpectedError.value.trim():'',note:sampleSource.value==='live'?'实时获取':sampleSource.value==='document'?'历史文档':'粘贴样例'});await loadSamples();await previewSample(sample.id);ElMessage.success('样例已保存并完成预览');}catch(e){ElMessage.error(errorText(e));}finally{busy.value=false;}}
async function previewSample(id:number){if(!version.value)return;if(dirty.value){ElMessage.warning('预览使用已保存版本，请先保存当前规则');return;}busy.value=true;try{preview.value=await api.samplePreview({version_id:version.value.id,sample_id:id});checks.value=[];checkError.value='';activeTab.value='preview';}catch(e){ElMessage.error(errorText(e));}finally{busy.value=false;}}
async function deleteSample(id:number){try{await api.sampleDelete(id);await loadSamples();preview.value=null;checks.value=[];checkError.value='';ElMessage.success('样例已删除');}catch(e){ElMessage.error(errorText(e));}}
async function checkSamples(){if(!version.value)return;if(dirty.value){ElMessage.warning('请先保存当前规则');return;}busy.value=true;try{const result=await api.sampleCheck(version.value.id);checks.value=result.checks||[];checkError.value=result.error||'';preview.value=checks.value.find(item=>!item.passed)||checks.value[0]||null;activeTab.value='preview';if(result.passed)ElMessage.success('全部样例回归通过');else ElMessage.error(result.error||'样例回归失败');}catch(e){ElMessage.error(errorText(e));}finally{busy.value=false;}}
async function publish(){if(!version.value)return;if(dirty.value){ElMessage.warning('请先保存当前规则');return;}busy.value=true;try{await api.validate(version.value.id);const result=await api.sampleCheck(version.value.id);checks.value=result.checks||[];checkError.value=result.error||'';preview.value=checks.value.find(item=>!item.passed)||checks.value[0]||null;activeTab.value='preview';if(!result.passed){ElMessage.error(result.error||'发布检查未通过');return;}const liveSubscriptions=selectedWorkflow.value?.dataset_id?(await api.pluginSubscriptions(selectedWorkflow.value.dataset_id,selectedWorkflow.value.id)).list:[];const effects=(liveSubscriptions||[]).filter(item=>item.enabled).map(item=>item.plugin_code+' / '+item.event_type+' / '+item.url_field);await ElMessageBox.confirm('所有样例回归通过。发布后正式运行将写入数据集。'+(effects.length?' 启用的外部副作用：'+effects.join('；')+'。':' 当前没有启用的插件订阅。'),'发布检查');await api.publish(version.value.id);await load();ElMessage.success('版本已发布');}catch(e){if(e!=='cancel')ElMessage.error(errorText(e));}finally{busy.value=false;}}
async function runNow(){if(!selectedWorkflow.value)return;try{await ElMessageBox.confirm('正式运行会采集目标页面并写入数据集。','手动运行');const result=await api.run(selectedWorkflow.value.id);ElMessage.success('运行已创建');router.push({path:'/workspace/runs',query:{id:String(result.run_id)}});}catch(e){if(e!=='cancel')ElMessage.error(errorText(e));}}
watch(projectId,()=>{selectedId.value=0;wizardOpen.value=false;load();});watch(()=>[route.query.id,route.query.version],([id,requested])=>{if(Number(id)&&workflows.value.some(w=>w.id===Number(id))&&(Number(id)!==selectedId.value||(Number(requested)&&Number(requested)!==version.value?.id)))selectWorkflow(Number(id));});watch(sampleRole,role=>{if(role!=='list'&&sampleOutcome.value==='empty_list')sampleOutcome.value='success';});watch(()=>[wizard.datasetId,wizard.templateCode],()=>{if(wizardOpen.value)refreshWizardRule();});watch(definition,()=>{if(!jsonFocused.value)definitionText.value=JSON.stringify(definition.value,null,2);},{deep:true});onMounted(load);
</script>
<style scoped>.collector-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:260px minmax(0,1fr);gap:17px}.collector-list{align-self:start}.collector-item{width:100%;padding:12px 10px;text-align:left;border:0;border-top:1px solid var(--v21-line);background:#fff;color:var(--v21-ink);cursor:pointer}.collector-item.active,.collector-item:hover{background:#eff3fb}.collector-item strong,.collector-item small{display:block}.collector-item small{color:var(--v21-muted)}.collector-head,.preview-head{display:flex;align-items:start;justify-content:space-between;gap:15px}.collector-head h2{margin:4px 0 9px;font-size:24px}.collector-tabs{display:flex;gap:8px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--v21-line);margin:19px 0}.collector-tabs button{border:0;background:transparent;padding:12px 15px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--v21-muted)}.collector-tabs button.active{color:#3657a6;font-weight:700;border-bottom:2px solid #3657a6}.editor-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(280px,.78fr);gap:18px;margin-top:18px}.editor-form,.editor-preview{border:1px solid var(--v21-line);border-radius:10px;padding:18px;min-width:0}.form-pair{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:10px}.editor-form details{margin:16px 0}.editor-form details summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:10px}.editor-form details input{width:100%;box-sizing:border-box}@media(max-width:650px){.form-pair{grid-template-columns:1fr}}.editor-form h3,.editor-preview h3{margin:0 0 14px}.rule-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:120px 1fr 95px;gap:7px;align-items:center;margin:7px 0}.rule-row label{font-weight:700;font-size:12px}.rule-row label span{font-size:10px;color:#b56822}.rule-row input{min-width:0;border:1px solid #cfd8e4;border-radius:7px;padding:8px}.json-editor{margin-top:15px}.json-editor textarea{min-height:260px;font:12px/1.5 Consolas,monospace}.step-card{border:1px solid var(--v21-line);border-radius:9px;padding:13px;margin:10px 0}.step-card>div{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center}.step-card small{color:var(--v21-muted)}.step-card dl{display:grid;grid-template-columns:120px minmax(0,1fr);gap:4px;margin-bottom:0}.step-card dt{color:var(--v21-muted)}.step-card dd{margin:0;word-break:break-word}.sample-checks{margin-bottom:20px}.check-item{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;width:100%;padding:12px;text-align:left;border:1px solid var(--v21-line);background:#fff;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer;margin:7px 0}.check-item.active{border-color:var(--v21-blue);background:var(--v21-soft)}.check-item strong,.check-item small{display:block}.check-item small{color:var(--v21-muted);word-break:break-word}.wizard-steps{display:flex;gap:7px;margin:0 0 20px;flex-wrap:wrap}.wizard-steps span{padding:5px 9px;border-radius:99px;background:#edf1f7;color:#6c7788;font-size:11px}.wizard-steps span.active{background:#3657a6;color:#fff}@media(max-width:1050px){.collector-layout,.editor-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.collector-list{max-height:260px;overflow:auto}}@media(max-width:650px){.rule-row{grid-template-columns:1fr}.collector-head{flex-direction:column}}</style>
